#: ../../source/docs/ros2-sitl.rst:5 eda882a3886447f79f2fc1268e66fa5f
msgid "ROS 2 with SITL"
msgstr "ROS 2 与 SITL"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-sitl.rst:7 57a63691f823481baf9001742c90cf07
msgid ""
"Once ROS2 is correctly :ref:`installed <ros2>`, and SITL is also "
":ref:`installed <sitl-simulator-software-in-the-loop>`, source your "
"workspace and launch ArduPilot SITL with ROS 2!"
msgstr ""
"正确 :ref:`安装 <ros2>` ROS 2 并 :ref:`安装 <sitl-simulator-software-in-the-loop>` "
"SITL 后，激活工作空间并使用 ROS 2 启动 ArduPilot SITL！"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-sitl.rst:9 e85e6e103da24abdabc788fa62c36e5c
msgid ""
"You will need to run this command on every new shell you open to have access"
" to the ROS 2 commands, like so:"
msgstr "每次打开新 shell 时都需要运行此命令以访问 ROS 2 命令，如下所示："

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-sitl.rst:13 21a82cd382114f47b352563b2e6974e9
msgid "ArduPilot 4.5"
msgstr "ArduPilot 4.5"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-sitl.rst:36 9c2eea8868364f0abf0a3043c4380a15
msgid "ArduPilot 4.6 and later"
msgstr "ArduPilot 4.6 及更新版本"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-sitl.rst:59 5ee2420d0a6a4b9bad7ce1bd3b75cd50
msgid ""
"For more information refer to `ardupilot/Tools/ros2/README.md "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/Tools/ros2#readme>`__. "
"There you can find examples of launches using serial connection instead of "
"udp, as well as a step-by-step breakdown of what the launch files are doing."
msgstr ""
"更多信息请参阅 `ardupilot/Tools/ros2/README.md "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/Tools/ros2#readme>`__。其中包含使用串口连接（而非"
" UDP）的启动示例，以及对启动文件步骤的详细说明。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-sitl.rst:63 b6cf5b08ae0c48deb338fe4219eb2cb8
msgid "ROS 2 CLI"
msgstr "ROS 2 CLI"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-sitl.rst:65 76953bf588c740f0962c8daa476b06a5
msgid ""
"Once everything is running, you can now interact with ArduPilot through the "
"ROS 2 CLI."
msgstr "一切运行正常后，您现在可以通过 ROS 2 CLI 与 ArduPilot 交互。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-sitl.rst:77 b06191bcdb73408582aa340a61e7efb0
msgid ""
"If the ROS 2 topics aren't being published, ensure the ardupilot parameter "
"ref:`DDS_ENABLE<DDS_ENABLE>` is set to 1 and reboot the launch."
msgstr ""
"如果 ROS 2 话题未被发布，请确保 ArduPilot 参数 ref:`DDS_ENABLE<DDS_ENABLE>` 已设置为 1，并重新启动。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-sitl.rst:87 04a9365d3a00465286ea5f9405ee87d0
msgid ""
"Another aspect to check, ensure the ArduPilot parameter "
"ref:`DDS_DOMAIN_ID<DDS_DOMAIN_ID>` matches your enviornment variable "
"``ROS_DOMAIN_ID``. The default is ``0`` for ArduPilot, which corresponds to "
"the environment variable being unset."
msgstr ""
"另外需要检查：确保 ArduPilot 参数 ref:`DDS_DOMAIN_ID<DDS_DOMAIN_ID>` 与您的环境变量 "
"``ROS_DOMAIN_ID`` 一致。ArduPilot 的默认值为 ``0``，对应于环境变量未设置的情况。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-sitl.rst:91 3ca5ee516dab46ac8ed1590aa548f0c6
msgid "MAVProxy"
